ordinary line parses as JSON: true
ordinary line is one line: true
ordinary line has no byte below U+0020: true
diverged line parses as JSON: true
diverged line is one line: true
diverged line has no byte below U+0020: true
a diverged loss trajectory keeps its finite steps and nulls the rest: true
an unmeasured time is null, not a number: true
an arm that timed nothing reports null times: true
a diagnostic survives as a scrubbed string: true
every arm names the objective its times were measured under: true
a contention-affected arm preserves its refusal count: true
an arm's no-batch refusals reach the wire apart from its contention count: true
an arm with no crowned candidate reports a null tensorization, not a label: true
the three tensorization labels reach the wire: true
a tensorized label over a scalar-fallback emission is visible as the pair: true
an untuned result carries the compiled MMA census without a tune object: true
the shipped artifact's census is carried apart from the arms': true
a cell that measured no footprint reports null bytes and null counter, not zero: true
a measured footprint carries its byte count and names the counter it came from: true
a tune object that recorded no shipped census says null, not a label: true
every dominant-kernel object parses as JSON: true
an exact memory-bound kernel attains its roofline over its time: 1 ms of bytes in 4 ms is 25%: true
the f16-native ceiling doubles the flops constant, and compute binds at 50%: true
an inexact or opaque count prints no number, but keeps its counts on the line: true
an inexact count on the leg that does not bind leaves the attainment exact: true
one missing envelope leg is no ceiling, naming the missing leg: true
a GPU tensor-core kernel is not scored against the scalar f32 constant: true
a C backend's register tile keeps the scalar ceiling, since it runs on the SIMD units: true
a kernel that was never timed carries no counts and says why: true
a cell that did not run the instrument says null on the result line: true
a cell that ran it carries the object: true

